.news/items/cty34utgc5ppbdnayf7cnjqlv","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cty34utgc5ppbdnayf7cnjqlv","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cty34utgc5ppbdnayf7cnjqlv","published_at":"2026-11-19T16:19:15Z","ref":"A12","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"X：Aravind Srinivas（Perplexity CEO） (@AravSrinivas)","summary":"Perplexity CEO Aravind Srinivas 分享 Computer 中 Brain 智能体的自我改进技能研究：Brain 会读取历史会话轨迹（工具调用、推理、结果），识别重复模式，仅在证据足够时提议新技能或更新。","title":"Perplexity Computer 的 Brain 智能体可自动编写和更新个人技能","title_en":"Sharing new research on self-improving skills in Perplexity Computer. Brain, which already maintains a knowledge wiki about your work, no...","url":"https://x.com/AravSrinivas/status/2123451045657690627"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/a8d06cpj4vy2dkdzazgsqsrwx","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"a8d06cpj4vy2dkdzazgsqsrwx","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/a8d06cpj4vy2dkdzazgsqsrwx","published_at":"2026-11-19T14:54:39Z","ref":"A13","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"TechCrunch 分析 Anthropic IPO 如何检验 AI 行业的循环融资模式。Amazon 14.7% 股份价值超 1590 亿美元，Google 13.7% 股份约 1490 亿美元；Nvidia、AMD、Microsoft、Broadcom、Micron、TSMC 还以 83 美元/股参与 260 亿美元私募。","title":"Anthropic IPO 检验 AI 循环融资模式，Amazon 和 Google 持股市值约 3079 亿美元","title_en":"Anthropic’s IPO puts AI’s circular financing boom to the test","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/19/anthropics-ipo-puts-ais-circular-financing-boom-to-the-test/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/zs46vfwtzhs7fzho1p17mfisf","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"zs46vfwtzhs7fzho1p17mfisf","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/zs46vfwtzhs7fzho1p17mfisf","published_at":"2026-11-19T14:25:37Z","ref":"A14","score":84,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"The Verge 报道 Anthropic 完成 IPO，募资 813 亿美元，超过 SpaceX 成为史上估值最高的上市，完全稀释市值约 1.5 万亿美元。","title":"Anthropic 完成史上最大规模 IPO，其安全治理结构受到审视","title_en":"With the biggest IPO of all time, Anthropic’s ‘good guy’ repu